{"seq":1,"slug":"whole-life-and-embodied-carbon","title":"全生命周期碳与隐含碳核算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/fundamentals-carbon/whole-life-and-embodied-carbon","wordCount":2018,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"全生命周期碳与隐含碳核算\">全生命周期碳与隐含碳核算</h1><p>谈一栋建筑「碳排多少」，关键不在它每年烧多少电，而在你把镜头拉多远。一座按 2025 年英国规范建造的写字楼，运营阶段每年的碳可能只占其四十年总碳的一小部分——因为电网在脱碳、热泵在替代锅炉，而那些一次性灌进去的混凝土、钢材、幕墙玻璃，从开工那天起就已经把碳排进了大气，且再也收不回来。这就是「全生命周期碳」与「隐含碳」要回答的核心：把一栋楼从矿山到拆除的每一克温室气体都摊开记账，并辨认出哪些是「先付清、不可逆」的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从生命周期阶段到隐含碳\">核心概念：从生命周期阶段到隐含碳</h2><p>全生命周期碳评估（Whole Life Carbon Assessment, WLCA）的骨架来自欧洲标准 <strong>EN 15978</strong>，它把建筑生命周期切成几组带编号的「模块」，每个模块对应一段时间窗与一类排放边界（<a href=\"https://www.london.gov.uk/publications/whole-life-cycle-carbon-assessments-guidance\">EN 15978 模块划分，London City Hall WLC 指南</a>）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;A1-A3 产品阶段&lt;br/&gt;原料开采·运输·制造&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;A4-A5 施工阶段&lt;br/&gt;运至现场·安装施工&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;B1-B7 使用阶段&lt;br/&gt;运维·更换·运营能耗用水&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;C1-C4 寿命终止&lt;br/&gt;拆除·运输·废料处理·处置&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;D 边界外&lt;br/&gt;再利用·回收的收益与负荷&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; F[&quot;隐含碳 = A + B(含材料部分) + C + D&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;上游隐含碳 Upfront = A1-A5&lt;br/&gt;实际完工前已排定&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"A1-A3 产品阶段&lt;br/&gt;原料开采·运输·制造\"] --&gt; B[\"A4-A5 施工阶段&lt;br/&gt;运至现场·安装施工\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"B1-B7 使用阶段&lt;br/&gt;运维·更换·运营能耗用水\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"C1-C4 寿命终止&lt;br/&gt;拆除·运输·废料处理·处置\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"D 边界外&lt;br/&gt;再利用·回收的收益与负荷\"]\n  A --&gt; F[\"隐含碳 = A + B(含材料部分) + C + D\"]\n  B --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[\"上游隐含碳 Upfront = A1-A5&lt;br/&gt;实际完工前已排定\"]</pre><p>把这些模块按「碳什么时候排、能不能挽回」重新归类，就得到核算里最常用的三组术语：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>覆盖模块</th>\n<th>时间特征</th>\n<th>为什么重要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运营碳（Operational，详见 <a href=\"operational-carbon-and-energy-benchmarks\">运营碳与能效基准</a>）</td>\n<td>B6 能耗、B7 用水</td>\n<td>全生命周期持续发生</td>\n<td>随电网脱碳逐年下降，可后期改善</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐含碳（Embodied）</td>\n<td>A1–A5、B1–B5、C1–C4、D</td>\n<td>集中在建造期与更换/拆除节点</td>\n<td>多为一次性、不可逆，决定权在设计阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上游隐含碳（Upfront）</td>\n<td>A1–A5</td>\n<td>实际完工前全部排定</td>\n<td>「先付清」的碳，是当下减排的主战场</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「上游隐含碳」（upfront carbon）的精确定义是材料与施工过程直到实际完工（practical completion）为止的温室气体排放，即 RICS 标准里的 A1–A5 模块（<a href=\"https://www.ribaj.com/intelligence/how-to-calculate-embodied-carbon-for-riba-2030-climate-challenge/\">RIBA Journal：为 2030 气候挑战计算隐含碳</a>）。它之所以被单拎出来，是因为这部分碳在动土之前就已被设计决策锁死，且没有任何「日后电网变绿」的机会来稀释它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核算怎么算-边界-清单与计算式\">核算怎么算：边界、清单与计算式</h2><p>一次 WLCA 在数学上并不复杂，难的是边界一致与数据可信。单个产品的隐含碳是「用量 × 排放因子」的累加，再叠加更换次数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{embodied} = \\sum_{i} m_i \\cdot f_i \\cdot \\left(1 + n_i\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mb</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是材料 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的用量（如吨钢、立方米混凝土），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其单位隐含碳排放因子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">kgCO_2e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 每单位），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是设计寿命内的更换次数。整栋楼再按楼面面积归一，得到便于横向比较的强度指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = \\frac{C_{total}}{GFA} \\quad \\left[kgCO_2e / m^2\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GF</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>排放因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的来源决定了结果可信度。优先级从高到低是：产品级<strong>环境产品声明（EPD）</strong> &gt; 行业平均数据库 &gt; 通用数据库。英国实践中常用的通用基线是 ICE（Inventory of Carbon and Energy）数据库，而英国净零碳建筑标准明确要求，结构、幕墙、主要饰面等高影响构件应尽量使用 EPD 支撑的产品级数据，否则很难做出经得起审核的提交（<a href=\"https://oneclicklca.com/en/resources/articles/resources/articles/uk-net-zero-carbon-buildings-standard-design-delivery-compliance-one-click-lca\">One Click LCA：英国净零碳建筑标准设计与合规</a>）。</p>\n<p>EN 15978 负责定义「评估什么、边界划在哪」，而 <strong>RICS 全生命周期碳评估标准（WLCA，第 2 版）</strong> 负责定义「行业该如何在真实项目上一致地把它算出来」。第 2 版已于 2024 年生效并扩展到覆盖所有建筑与基础设施，对齐 EN 15978、EN 17472、EN 15643、EN 15804 等环境性能标准（<a href=\"https://circularecology.com/news/rics-whole-life-carbon-assessment-2nd-edition-now-in-effect\">Circular Ecology：RICS WLCA 第 2 版现已生效</a>）。换句话说，标准之间是「规范层（EN）」与「操作层（RICS）」的分工，做核算时两者要一起看。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据从哪来-epd-与数据库的可信度阶梯\">数据从哪来：EPD 与数据库的可信度阶梯</h2><p>排放因子是整个核算里最容易被「软处理」的环节——同一根钢梁，用通用数据库可能算出一个数，用某家钢厂的电炉钢 EPD 可能只有它的一半。因此 2026 年前后的趋势是把数据来源本身当作审核对象。</p>\n<p>环境产品声明（EPD）是依据 EN 15804 编制、经第三方核验的产品级生命周期数据文件，给出该产品 A1–A3（乃至更多模块）的碳值。英国净零碳建筑标准把「为所有指定材料/产品取得 EPD」列为稳健提交的前提条件之一（<a href=\"https://epd.guide/environmental-regulations-and-laws/uk-net-zero-building-standard-what-manufacturers-must-know\">EPD Guide：英国净零建筑标准对制造商的要求</a>）。实践中的取数策略是分层的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>高影响构件（结构、幕墙、主要饰面）——必须 EPD 支撑，减排才可测量、可辩护；</li>\n<li>中等构件——行业平均 EPD 或经核验的行业数据库；</li>\n<li>低影响、零碎构件——通用数据库（如 ICE）兜底，并在报告中标注数据来源等级。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种「可信度阶梯」直接影响结论。一份所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都来自通用平均值的评估，只能说明设计意图；只有当高碳构件换上真实产品 EPD，「我比基线省了 30%」这句话才站得住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是当下的硬约束-从自愿目标到强制限值\">为什么是当下的硬约束：从自愿目标到强制限值</h2><p>隐含碳从「锦上添花的可持续叙事」变成「项目准入门槛」，发生得比很多人预期得快。三条线索值得记账。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>自愿目标在收紧</strong>。RIBA 2030 气候挑战已与 LETI、全生命周期碳网络等对齐：现行规范等效水平约为住宅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\ kgCO_2e/m^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、商业 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1100\\ kgCO_2e/m^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1100</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而 2030 目标分别压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;500\\ kgCO_2e/m^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://www.mesh-energy.com/insights/riba-2030-climate-challenge-how-can-we-reduce-embodied-carbon-by-at-least-50-70\">Mesh Energy：RIBA 2030 气候挑战如何减隐含碳 50–70%</a>）。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>评奖与采信开始硬性要数据</strong>。RIBA 2026 年度奖项首次在报名环节就要求提交隐含碳数据，与英国净零碳建筑标准、RIBA 2030 气候挑战的贡献相对齐（<a href=\"https://www.riba.org/explore/awards/awards-processes/uk-awards-sustainability/\">RIBA UK 奖项可持续性指南</a>）。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>国家级标准正在落地</strong>。英国净零碳建筑标准（UKNZCBS）在 2025 年 3 月至 8 月开展试点，逾 200 个真实项目按试点标准做了测算；其 Annex A 按建筑类型、新建/改造分别设定隐含碳限值——例如新建高等教育建筑 2025 年上游碳限值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>475</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">475\\ kgCO_2e/m^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">475</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://ww3.rics.org/uk/en/journals/built-environment-journal/net-zero-carbon-buildings-standard-pilot.html\">RICS Built Environment Journal：净零碳建筑标准试点</a>）。该标准在 2025 年底/2026 年初推进正式版本，并预告随时间收紧：运营能耗限值到 2030 年收紧约 10–15%，而上游碳限值收紧约 25–30%（<a href=\"https://www.bcis.co.uk/news/major-update-confirms-uk-net-zero-carbon-buildings-standard-on-course-for-2026-launch/\">BCIS：英国净零碳建筑标准确认 2026 年发布</a>）。</p>\n<p>下面这条决策链解释了为什么减隐含碳的杠杆几乎全在前期：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;概念/方案阶段&lt;br/&gt;选址·结构体系·改造vs新建&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;决定 ~80% 隐含碳&lt;br/&gt;此时改动成本最低&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;扩初/施工图&lt;br/&gt;材料规格·EPD 选型&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;建造 A4-A5&lt;br/&gt;碳已基本排定&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;运营 B6-B7&lt;br/&gt;仅能影响运营碳&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; F[&quot;最大减碳窗口在最左端&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"概念/方案阶段&lt;br/&gt;选址·结构体系·改造vs新建\"] --&gt; B[\"决定 ~80% 隐含碳&lt;br/&gt;此时改动成本最低\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"扩初/施工图&lt;br/&gt;材料规格·EPD 选型\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"建造 A4-A5&lt;br/&gt;碳已基本排定\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"运营 B6-B7&lt;br/&gt;仅能影响运营碳\"]\n  A --&gt; F[\"最大减碳窗口在最左端\"]</pre><p>值得一提的是英国曾推动的 <strong>Part Z</strong> 提案——拟把强制性隐含碳上限先用于「揪出排放最高的项目」，限值会比净零标准更宽松，但能把整个建筑业引向 1.5°C 轨迹（<a href=\"https://www.riba.org/work/insights-and-resources/professional-features/how-can-architects-reinvigorate-support-for-part-z/\">RIBA：建筑师如何重振对 Part Z 的支持</a>）。这意味着隐含碳核算的终局是法规化，而非长期停留在自愿层面——欧盟 EPBD、中国 GB 55015、美国城市 BPS 如何把全生命周期碳写成强制约束，详见 <a href=\"../certification-policy-practice/net-zero-policy-and-codes\">零碳政策与建筑节能法规</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>全生命周期碳按 EN 15978 模块（A 建造、B 使用、C 寿终、D 边界外）记账；其中 A1–A5 的「上游隐含碳」在完工前已不可逆地排定，是当下减排主战场。</li>\n<li>标准分工要分清：EN 15978/EN 15804 定义「评什么、边界在哪」，RICS WLCA 第 2 版（已扩展到全部建筑与基础设施）定义「真实项目怎么一致地算」。</li>\n<li>核算结果的可信度由排放因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的来源决定，遵循「产品级 EPD &gt; 行业数据库 &gt; 通用数据库（如 ICE）」的阶梯，高影响构件须 EPD 支撑。</li>\n<li>强度指标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = C_{total}/GFA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GF</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">kgCO_2e/m^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）是横向比较与达标判定的通用度量；RIBA 2030 把住宅压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span>、商业 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>2026 年隐含碳正从自愿目标走向硬约束：RIBA 奖项报名即要数据，英国净零碳建筑标准设建筑类型限值（如新建高校 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>475</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">475\\ kgCO_2e/m^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">475</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）并预告上游碳每阶段再收紧 25–30%。</li>\n<li>减碳杠杆集中在概念与方案阶段——选址、结构体系、改造优先于新建——越往后能动的越少。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"全生命周期碳与隐含碳核算","id":"全生命周期碳与隐含碳核算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从生命周期阶段到隐含碳","id":"核心概念-从生命周期阶段到隐含碳"},{"level":2,"text":"核算怎么算：边界、清单与计算式","id":"核算怎么算-边界-清单与计算式"},{"level":2,"text":"数据从哪来：EPD 与数据库的可信度阶梯","id":"数据从哪来-epd-与数据库的可信度阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是当下的硬约束：从自愿目标到强制限值","id":"为什么是当下的硬约束-从自愿目标到强制限值"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"运营碳与建筑能效基准 (Operational Carbon and Energy Benchmarks)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/fundamentals-carbon/operational-carbon-and-energy-benchmarks"}}